This is Free Online Guitar Lessons for Beginners on Meethi Boliyaan Guitar Chords and lyrics. For those who doesn't go to guitar classes can learn to play guitar here for free. Songs are given with lyrics for your ease. The soulful track has been sung by Singer Mili Nair and Amit Trivedi. The Lyricists is Swanand Kirkire.

